  "system": {
    "description": {
      "value": "<p>You fuel your magic with your body with purpose, refining it more than ever before.</p>\n<p><strong>Prerequisites:</strong> Addictive Casting drawback or Decrepit Casting drawback, magic skill bonus 5 .</p>\n<p><strong>Benefit:</strong> When you create a sphere effect, you can choose to fail your saving throw from the drawback used to qualify for this feat in order to fuel the power behind the sphere effect.</p>\n<p>The sphere effect manifests with a +1 competence bonus to its caster level, and costs 1 less spell point (minimum 0). Sphere effects reduced to 0 spell points still count as if they cost at least 1 spell point when determining the effects of your drawbacks.</p>\n<p>You can utilize this feat three times per day, plus an additional use at 8th level and every 3 levels thereafter.</p>\n<p><a href=\"http://spheresofpower.wikidot.com/drawback-feats#toc11\">Source: Spheres of Power Wiki</a></p>",
      "instructions": ""
    },
